     3588         b1-gds-zap-other      format "->>>>>>>>>>9.<<<" when (p2 = 1) @  gds-zap-other
     3589         with FRAME ZAPAS .
     3590   if Make-Excel then  put   stream ForExcel unformatted
     3591     p3 CHR(9)
     3592     p4 CHR(9)
